<title>GERMANY: Veba -group 9-mo net profit up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Veba -group 9-mo net profit up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   1,227   vs 980</p>
<p>    Group sales				  55,310  vs 54,554</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified energy, chemicals and services group is Veba AG.</p>
